>>> (the problem with "than" in gismu definitions that was probably solved in
>>> Lojban).
>>> In my opinion /dio/ leads to some language-specific metaphors
>>> (beneficiary being kinda destination).
>>>
>>
>> I'm sorry, is this something like the BAI? Otherwise I don't get it.
>>
>>
>>> But on the other hand, don't recent (and actually eternal) suggestions
>>> to remove some frequent sumti places suggest something similar?
>>>
>>
>> I know of no suggestions to remove frequent sumti places. Perhaps you
>> meant INfrequent, as in the places that are rarely if ever used, and
